# ==============================================================================
# KeepPass Vault — configuration
# ==============================================================================
# The app has NO server-side secrets anymore. Everything sensitive is encrypted in
# the browser; the Cloudflare Worker only stores ciphertext.
#
# Deployment secrets live in GitHub, not in this file:
#   GitHub › Settings › Secrets and variables › Actions
#     CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN   (required)  – Cloudflare token, template "Edit Cloudflare Workers"
#     CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID  (optional)  – only needed if the token sees several accounts
#
# For deploying from your own computer instead (`npm run deploy:production`):
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=""
CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=""
